8379824,2024-02-20,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Getting a loan or lease,Confusing or misleading advertising or marketing,"CFPB COMPLAINT : I am writing to formally assert my rights and to address multiple violations that have occurred in relation to my dealings with Credit Acceptance Corporation and XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, specifically concerning the financing and subsequent mishandling of my account associated with a XXXX XXXX XXXX, VIN : XXXX, Account Number : XXXX. 

