8398255,2024-02-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"RE : Credit acceptance Account XXXX and XXXX I, XXXX XXXX, am a federally protected consumer, and victim of identity theft. I am writing to formally exercise my right to opt out of, as per the provisions of the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act ( 15 USC 6802 ) and the Privacy Act of 1974. 
