e to believe that the information is inaccurate. 15 U.S. Code 1681e states, ''Every consumer reporting agency shall maintain reasonable procedures designed to avoid violations of section 1681c of this title and to limit the furnishing of consumer reports to the purposes listed under section 1681b of this title. XXXX, XXXX, and XXXX are not maintaining reasonable procedures. Furthermore, 12 CFR 1016.7 states that, "" A consumer may exercise the right to opt out at any time. I am opting out of your reporting services. 
