8421600,2024-02-27,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I am writing to bring to your attention a concerning discrepancy in the reporting of my credit history by Experian, one of the major credit reporting agencies. Specifically, I am disputing the late payment reported on my credit card account with XXXX XXXX, account number XXXX. 

