In light of these violations and the resulting impact on my financial rights, I request that the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau investigate this matter and take appropriate action to rectify the inaccuracies in XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX reporting. I also request that XXXXXXXX XXXX be held accountable for their failure to provide me with the necessary opt-out information as required by law. 

